{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The absence of the Chief has allowed invading powers into goblin lands. Big folk adventurers, other smaller monsters, and even the land itself threaten to uproot goblin existence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881810/extras/682426f650ec2906a628df7f7f51412b.avif?t=1753724710\" width=616 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881810/extras/bbc3b55a0a8c7337543814fed89025ca.poster.avif?t=1753724710\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881810/extras/bbc3b55a0a8c7337543814fed89025ca.webm?t=1753724710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881810/extras/bbc3b55a0a8c7337543814fed89025ca.mp4?t=1753724710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as an average goblin trying to survive and thrive among tribes at war. Play solo, co-op, or PvP with up to 16 total players! Take control of your wardrobe with many unlockable cosmetic options to make your goblin the most dapper or fearsome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881810/extras/7fc6561066342a66d6021efdc33e50e5.avif?t=1753724710\" width=616 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881810/extras/571c5f07c78aba626462fb4420c0d1ef.poster.avif?t=1753724710\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881810/extras/571c5f07c78aba626462fb4420c0d1ef.webm?t=1753724710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881810/extras/571c5f07c78aba626462fb4420c0d1ef.mp4?t=1753724710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 5 weapon categories and carry two weapons at a time. Each goblin can have 5 abilities, which require certain weapon types to be used. Juggle your weapons and abilities to come out ahead!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881810/extras/85c8bf8a51e07c8f88e835cf33ee5422.avif?t=1753724710\" width=616 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881810/extras/58127bb3e3c6578c0f3abacf357aaacb.poster.avif?t=1753724710\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881810/extras/58127bb3e3c6578c0f3abacf357aaacb.webm?t=1753724710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881810/extras/58127bb3e3c6578c0f3abacf357aaacb.mp4?t=1753724710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield powerful abilities that apply status effects. Stun, snare, send foes to sleep, root them in place, make them bleed, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881810/extras/b659574f64a223a8941adbb9aa8083a7.avif?t=1753724710\" width=616 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881810/extras/31bdb6ab3f4b293f750982992abd17ef.poster.avif?t=1753724710\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881810/extras/31bdb6ab3f4b293f750982992abd17ef.webm?t=1753724710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881810/extras/31bdb6ab3f4b293f750982992abd17ef.mp4?t=1753724710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain experience in matches to unlock new abilities and items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Mode - Play with your friends to survive as long as you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free For All - Fight against your friends to see who should be the next Chief.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team Match - Protect your tribe against threats. Foil the plans of other player tribes and plunder the riches of the goblin world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881810/extras/b2e18f53ea70702645be31cc63dd8802.avif?t=1753724710\" width=616 height=240 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3881810?t=1753724710","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881810/596dd41784d0871489eab5a787e23fa3bf8f7199/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753724710","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881810/740f1cf02ea7cc9a90923d615cf0ef52f1767afa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753724710","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akama